script = ExtResource("1_h6la2")
title = "Hold It Down"
body = "You'll notice the \"dominion\" resource at the top left of the screen. You aggregate dominion by keeping your warlords among your army.

To win this scenario, keep your army alive until you've aggregated 1000 dominion. Be aware that you'll need to keep recruiting more belligerents if you want to make it there."
